//! This repository's C API (the headers in include/) implemented on Orbis
//! (https://github.com/sargunv/orbis), as a static library that stands in for
//! the C++ `maplibre_native_c` library.
//!
//! Each runtime is a thread that owns an Orbis runtime and its maps and
//! render sessions. The functions this crate doesn't implement are stubs in
//! `stubs.rs` (generated by tools/gen_stubs.py) that return
//! MLN_STATUS_UNSUPPORTED.

